<title>USA: Moody's raises Novi, Mich.,$11.225 mln deal to A1.</title>
<headline>Moody's raises Novi, Mich.,$11.225 mln deal to A1.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Jan 17 - Moody's Investors Service - Rating Announcement As of 01/17/97.</p>
<p>    Issuer		: Novi</p>
<p>    State		 : MI</p>
<p>    Rating		: A1</p>
<p>    Sale Amount	 : 11,225,000</p>
<p>Expected Sale Date: 01/27/97</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
